--- 4.3.2 ---

010620	A scalar signal into a bused input is now duplicated in verilog as was
	done in spice.

010711	Added an option to Select Simulator menu in spice mode to
	specify the output data suffix.  For spice this defaults to
	.tr0 with the SPICE_SUFFIX(spice) variable but if running an
	ac simulation you want to change this to .ac0.
	
010712	Added & to print comment so it doesn't hang SUE until the print is done.

010713	Ignores duplicate property definitions in icons.

010716	Enhanced api_cell_info to return read_only status of cell and to take
	an optional property.

010716	Added a new "name_net" called a suggested_name.  It is part of
	the "name_net_s" generator -- i.e. just shift-double-click on
	a name_net and you will see it.  A suggested_name on a net
	will only name the net if nothing else names it -- i.e. it has
	a lower priority than either globals, I/O's or name_nets.
	Furthermore, unlike a name_net, nets with the same suggested
	name will NOT get tied together.  Instead, one of the nets
	will get a unique name.  The suggested names were added so
	that you can have unnamed nets whose name doesn't change with
	each netlisting.  To facilitate this, there is a new global
	variable called CREATE_SUGGESTED_NAMES which defaults to false
	(0) but when set to true (1) will added suggested_name icons
	to all unnamed nets after netlisting (technically after
	generating term names).  

010716	Added api_clipboard so you can cut, copy, and paste from
	the api.

010730	Added by_type option to api_select and new api_generate_inst_names.	
	Can also choose "Search by instance type" in the "Select by Name"
	menu.

010802	Options to starting sue are now case insensitive.  For
	example, can now do: sue -set foo=3

010806	Prompt, title, and icon name are now synchoronized visually
